{"metadata":{"ext":[{"Plain":"md"},1],"tag":[{"Plain":"百科"},3],"title":[{"Plain":"脉性单子"},2],"author":[{"Lazy":[{"Local":{"url":"SimplicialCat","text":"SimplicialCat"}}]},4],"slug":[{"Plain":"脉性单子"},0]},"content":{"Lazy":[{"Plain":"\n<h2>观念</h2>\n<p>脉性单子 (nervous monad) 是一个类似于"},{"Local":{"url":"带元数的单子","text":"带元数的单子"}},{"Plain":"的概念, 比它稍弱一些. 大致上, 对于给定的子范畴 $\\mathcal A\\subset\\mathcal E$, 称单子 $T\\colon \\mathcal E\\to\\mathcal E$ 具有 “脉性”, 说的是 $T$-"},{"Local":{"url":"单子上的代数","text":"代数"}},{"Plain":"可以用 $\\mathcal A$ 的对象生成的"},{"Local":{"url":"自由-遗忘伴随","text":"自由"}},{"Plain":"代数来"},{"Local":{"url":"探测","text":"探测"}},{"Plain":", 从而给出一个"},{"Local":{"url":"脉","text":"脉"}},{"Plain":"的刻画.</p>\n"}]}}